# Local data, secrets and tooling
apps/api/uploads
# Backups are kept outside the repository (deployment.md §8). These only keep
# a dump or archive left here by mistake out of the build context, which
# `COPY . .` would otherwise send to the builder: mongodump's default `dump/`
# folder, archives and their encrypted copies.
**/backups
dump
**/*.archive.gz
**/*.archive.gz.7z
**/uploads-*.tar.gz
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
.vscode
.idea

